ideas.proposal:
Turn the K2b machinery (the ignored test measure_clip_share plus k2b.sh) into a standing panel run on the 35x and hospital BAMs. It scores real held-out pairs against spike pairs remade at the same templates, plus a real-vs-real split of the held-out pairs as calibration. Report, with Q100 masking and the bench BED:
