ideas.proposal:
Write one script, scripts/realism_suite.sh BINARY, with fixed event lists and 2 seeds. It runs:
- round 1b (DELs) and round 2b/3 (small variants and DUPs);
- K1 and K2b (read statistics);
- the read-level discriminator;
